\section{Future Work}
\label{sec:future}

Our analysis suggests several natural extensions organized around three themes.

\paragraph{Multi-signal ensemble detection.}
DIF, ConStat, and DVD capture orthogonal contamination signals (pairwise correlations $r \leq 0.21$). Preliminary ensemble fusion achieves AUROC 0.89 with FPR 0.07 under 2-of-3 voting (Table~\ref{tab:ensemble}). Weighted fusion yields a modest improvement (AUROC 0.89 vs.\ 0.86 uniform), with stable cross-validated weights ($\sigma = 0.03$). A standalone methods paper exploring this ensemble is planned.

